%% D08 Control boundary (authority down / evidence back)
%% Type: architecture · Hero SVG: svg/D08.svg · Page: /architecture, /framework/principles
flowchart TB
  H["Human authority<br/>approves consequential decisions · retains override and restoration"]:::human
  CP["02 / Factory control plane — the factory governs<br/>identity · delegated authority · policy · budgets · routing · state · leases · evidence · decisions · audit<br/><i>Durable system of record</i>"]
  S["01 / Intelligence supply — models reason, agents act<br/>models · agents · skills · prompts · tool adapters<br/><i>Replaceable by design</i>"]
  X["03 / Governed execution — operation stays bounded<br/>Harness governs one Agent · Runtime hosts it · Sandbox isolates effects<br/>short-lived credentials · scoped capabilities · network, time, resource limits<br/><i>Constrained and recoverable</i>"]
  V["Independent verification<br/>producer is never the sole judge"]
  H -- "Decision" --> CP
  CP -- "authority flows down (solid)" --> S
  CP -- "authority flows down (solid)" --> X
  S -. "evidence flows back (dashed)" .-> CP
  X -. "Candidate + Evidence" .-> V
  V -. "verification result" .-> CP
  CH["Expected to change<br/>models · agents · skills · prompts · tool adapters"]:::neutral
  PS["Required to persist<br/>intent · identity · authority · state · evidence · decisions · outcomes"]:::neutral
  T["Allow intelligence to vary. Always bound authority."]:::neutral
  class CP control
  class S,X execution
  class V trust
